  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "A seal for «ميثاقهم»; no motif on Isa. 14:1-5 frames their name as a claim (Al-Muyassar). 14:13-19 is not glossed: both tafsirs paraphrase «فأغرينا» in Allah's first person. STAGING v4: Two small groups (2 each, no woman) in a town at dusk: both say their claim on 14:3-4 (the gloss frames it as a claim). Seal for the covenant (14:7). The enmity and hatred among them (14:13-16, a this-world fact in As-Sa'di) is shown only as the two groups turning their backs on each other and one shaking its head: no fighting, no weapon. Isa is not drawn. Geometric on the Name 14:22 while they are told of their deeds; nothing literal for the Day."
 },
